e game phases<br>    </li><li>Choose the color of your CIBOS<br>    </li><li>End-match challenges<br>    </li><li>A global score table (you play against players all around the world)<br>    </li><li>An easy grip of controls</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728090/extras/b73370fb001258dedc0d8e3bb352026b.poster.avif?t=1636047054\" width=546 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728090/extras/b73370fb001258dedc0d8e3bb352026b.webm?t=1636047054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/728090/extras/b73370fb001258dedc0d8e3bb352026b.mp4?t=1636047054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
